"affiliate and referral data will be DELETED on all sites of the network."
msgstr ""
"ATTENTION : Si cette option est active alors que le plugin est réseau désactivé, "
"TOUTES les données d'affiliation et de parrainage seront SUPPRIMÉES sur tous les "
"sites du réseau."

#: lib/core/class-affiliates-settings-general.php:284
msgid ""
"CAUTION: If you change this setting and have distributed affiliate links or "
"permalinks, make sure that these are updated. Unless the incoming affiliate links "
"reflect the current URL parameter name, no affiliate hits, visits or referrals will "
"be recorded."
